{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/lazy"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/lazy"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"code":"Sequence.lazy","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lazy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV","text":"LazySequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"extendedModule":"Swift","role":"symbol","title":"lazy","modules":[{"relatedModules":["Swift"],"name":"Cliques"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:STsE4lazys12LazySequenceVyxGvp::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lazy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV","text":"LazySequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"url":"\/documentation\/cliques","kind":"symbol","title":"Cliques","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","abstract":[]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/lazy":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/lazy","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lazy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV","text":"LazySequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"role":"symbol","title":"lazy","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/lazy","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","title":"MaximalCliques","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}]}}}